  description: It fell spinning once, by accident, and the host decided the terror
    was worth keeping. The spiral it trails has a hypnotist's patience.
  tactics: Sheds a slow rotating spiral of shots as it descends. Individual bullets
    are slow; the danger is the lattice they leave across lanes you wanted later.
    Cut it down early or accept fighting inside its web.
